{"cause":"The S5 acceptance test exposed that data-operation nodes had no API endpoint capable of starting a real model run; the requested model-run path returned HTTP 404.","cause_status":"known","event_id":"d0e1f2a3-b4c5-46d7-e8f9-0123456789ab","event_sha256":"dea6966369d7815ee5116d98eb02db1e7191bc03270cd2e8b2930c0016aae097","evidence":{"kind":"pytest","observed_at":"2026-08-03T13:45:00.000Z","ref":"tests/test_data_operations_v186.py::test_data_node_can_start_a_real_ols_run_with_cross_run_lineage","sha256":"eae5d8275d9c48f6981a6497c66c9b4488a3490eaff6bf5634cd5b1e28e34420"},"impact":"The visible merge/reshape/derive chain stopped before an executable model, so the S5 hard acceptance was incomplete despite the data Graph nodes being present.","incident_id":"e1f2a3b4-c5d6-47e8-f901-23456789abcd","lesson":"A data-operation Graph chain is not a model workflow until a typed user path dispatches the derived artifact into the existing run lifecycle and preserves source-node lineage.","lesson_key":"data-chain-must-end-in-real-model-run","links":["tests/test_data_operations_v186.py","backend/workbench/http/data_operation_routes.py","backend/workbench/services/run_service.py"],"prev_event_sha256":"ef374c73a502d732e5c5b6601ac832bdd4795959430ccceccc77c9a145ce720c","preventability":"preventable","resolution":"open","schema_version":1,"stage":"implementation","subtype":"tdd_red_data_node_model_run_missing","timestamp":"2026-08-03T13:45:00.000Z","type":"FAILURE"}
{"cause":"The expanded S5 Graph-chain acceptance initially dispatched only four reshape rows into the existing run lifecycle, which correctly blocked at the configured INSUFFICIENT_SAMPLE validation gate.","cause_status":"known","event_id":"e2f3a4b5-c6d7-48e9-9012-3456789abcde","event_sha256":"c2547ee63f13d1ba22f94c0269afbf7f48309e82569625017bdd0ed23de4c035","evidence":{"kind":"pytest","observed_at":"2026-08-03T13:31:51.000Z","ref":"tests/test_data_operations_v186.py::test_merge_to_reshape_derive_subset_keeps_cross_run_graph_chain_traceable","sha256":"1d53efbe3234ccaa04d00613fb74f1a0c5c370251e9ca489a237f4111668c342"},"impact":"The new full-chain assertion could not distinguish an incomplete model bridge from an undersized fixture until the run manifest and errors artifact were inspected.","incident_id":"f3a4b5c6-d7e8-4901-2345-6789abcdef01","lesson":"For acceptance tests that cross a real modeling lifecycle, satisfy the production sample gate and inspect the run errors artifact before changing production dispatch code.","lesson_key":"full-chain-fixture-must-clear-production-sample-gate","links":["tests/test_data_operations_v186.py","backend/workbench/http/data_operation_routes.py","backend/workbench/services/run_service.py"],"prev_event_sha256":"dea6966369d7815ee5116d98eb02db1e7191bc03270cd2e8b2930c0016aae097","preventability":"preventable","resolution":"resolved","schema_version":1,"stage":"integration","subtype":"acceptance_fixture_below_model_minimum","timestamp":"2026-08-03T13:31:51.000Z","type":"ERROR"}
